* SPICE netlist for the schematic

* NMOS Transistors
M1 4 2 0 0 NMOS ; Q1
M2 5 4 0 0 NMOS ; Q2

* Resistors
R1 1 2 1k ; R1 from v1 to net 2
R2 5 8 1k ; R2 from net 5 to v2
R3 2 0 20k ; Feedback Resistor for first Op-Amp
R4 3 0 20k ; Feedback Resistor for second Op-Amp
R5 4 3 333k ; Feedback Resistor for third Op-Amp
R6 4 6 20k ; Resistor connecting second Op-Amp to third Op-Amp
R7 6 3 333k ; Resistor in series with third Op-Amp

* Voltage Sources and Grounds
V1 1 0 DC ; Input voltage v1
V2 8 0 DC ; Input voltage v2

* Amplifiers (Op-Amps)
XU1 2 22 0 OPAMP ; First Op-Amp
XU2 5 4 0 OPAMP ; Second Op-Amp
XU3 6 4 3 OPAMP ; Third Op-Amp

* Definitions
.model NMOS NMOS level=1
.model OPAMP opamp_macro

.end